  "Miami Beach is a barrier island with salt air, high water and a lot of palms and sea grapes close to houses and condominiums. Trees there live with wind, salt and tight lots, and the city regulates them closely.",
  "Send one request and we will try to match you with an independent tree care professional. We are adding professionals in Miami Beach and cannot promise a response yet, so you can also tell us you want to be notified. SF Tree Removal is an online service; we don't do the work ourselves, so you agree the scope and price directly with the professional you are matched with."
